      "reproduction": "QA39663 is an analogous if-you-do discard ruling. Shikigoi tests choose ten distinct cards before the discard batch; four actual Carol replacements remain in hand, six cards reach grave, and the complete ten-card attempt still creates the additional turn. Cancellation or fewer than ten cards creates no discard and no extra turn.",
      "result": "QA39663 is an analogous if-you-do discard ruling. Shikigoi tests choose ten distinct cards before the discard batch; four actual Carol replacements remain in hand, six cards reach grave, and the complete ten-card attempt still creates the additional turn. Cancellation or fewer than ten cards creates no discard and no extra turn."
